    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>Stability without stagnation; pressure without cruelty.</em></p><p>When a friendly creature within <strong>6 squares</strong> of you fails a defense check against being <strong>Shaken</strong>, you can use your <strong>reaction</strong> to steady them.</p><ul><li>The creature rerolls the defense check and must use the new result.</li><li>You can use this feature a number of times equal to your <strong>tier</strong>, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Soma Break.</li></ul><p><strong>Strategic Layer.</strong> Once per <strong>turn</strong>, when your Domain spends marks to prevent a rebellion or unrest event in a <strong>Loyal</strong> hex, you may reduce that specific cost by <strong>10 marks</strong> (minimum 10). This represents the quiet confidence your presence anchors.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
